Start the text system with only the faces the application embeds

The web platform embeds IBM Plex Sans and Lilex from the root of the Zed
tree, which a crate built from its own directory cannot reach. The
application registers its own embedded faces, as it does on Linux, where
the text system starts without system fonts.

